bsidian CLI는 Obsidian 인스턴스와 상호작용하는 명령행 도구입니다","es":"obsidian-cli es una interfaz de línea de comandos para interactuar con instancias de Obsidian.","fr":"obsidian-cli est une interface de ligne de commande pour interagir avec des instances Obsidian.","de":"obsidian-cli ist eine Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle zur Interaktion mit Obsidian-Instanzen.","pt":"O Obsidian-CLI é uma interface de linha de comando para interagir com o Obsidian.","ru":"Obsidian-CLI - это командный интерфейс для взаимодействия с Obsidian.","ar":"Obsidian-CLI هو واجهة سطر أوامر للتفاعل مع Obsidian."},"features":{"en":["Runs `obsidian help` to display all available commands","Supports parameters with values using the `=` syntax","Allows quoting values with spaces for commands like `obsidian create`","Includes boolean flags like `silent` and `overwrit` for customization","Provides full documentation at https://help.obsidian.md/cli"],"zh":["支持创建和管理笔记","提供命令行参数和标志设置","支持silent和overwrite模式","可以使用obsidian help命令查看所有可用命令"],"ja":["ノートの作成と管理が可能","コマンドラインパラメータとフラグの設定が可能","サイレントモードと上書きモードをサポート","obsidian helpコマンドですべての使用可能なコマンドを確認可能"],"ko":["노트 생성 및 관리 기능","명령행 매개변수와 플래그 설정","サイレント 모드와 덮어쓰기 모드 지원","obsidian help 명령으로 모든 사용 가능한 명령어 확인"],"es":["Parámetros con valores asignados mediante el símbolo =","Banderas booleanas sin valor","Comando de ayuda para ver todos los comandos disponibles","Compatibilidad con valores con espacios mediante comillas","Documentación completa disponible en https://help.obsidian.md/cli"],"fr":["Paramètres avec des valeurs attribuées à l''aide du symbole =","Indicateurs booléens sans valeur","Commande d''aide pour afficher tous les commandes disponibles","Compatibilité avec des valeurs contenant des espaces via des guillemets","Documentation complète disponible sur https://help.obsidian.md/cli"],"de":["Parameter mit Werten, die über das =-Zeichen zugewiesen werden","Boolesche Flags ohne Wert","Hilfebefehl, um alle verfügbaren Befehle anzuzeigen","Unterstützung für Werte mit Leerzeichen durch Anführungszeichen","Vollständige Dokumentation verfügbar unter https://help.obsidian.md/cli"],"pt":["Parâmetros com valores atribuídos por igual (=)","Flags booleanos sem valor","Criação de notas com conteúdo personalizado","Suporte à execução de comandos em segunda plano"],"ru":["Параметры с значениями, присвоенными равенством (=)","Булевые флаги без значения","Создание заметок с настраиваемым содержимым","Поддержка выполнения команд в фоновом режиме"],"ar":["معلمات بالقيم المعينة بواسطة المساواة (=)","أعلام 논ية بدون قيمة","إنشاء الملاحظات بمحتوى مخصص","دعم تنفيذ الأوامر في وضع الخلفية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use obsidian-cli","obsidian-cli setup guide","obsidian-cli alternative","obsidian-cli vs other note-taking tools","obsidian-cli install","what is obsidian-cli","obsidian-cli command reference","obsidian-cli documentation"],"zh":["Obsidian CLI","命令行工具","笔记管理","Obsidian 实例","命令行参数","标志设置","silent模式","overwrite模式"],"ja":["Obsidian CLI","コマンドラインツール","ノート管理","Obsidian インスタンス","コマンドラインパラメータ","フラグ設定","サイレントモード","上書きモード","AIエージェント"],"ko":["Obsidian CLI","명령행 도구","노트 관리","Obsidian 인스턴스","명령행 매개변수","플래그 설정","サイレント 모드","덮어쓰기 모드","AI 툴"],"es":["obsidian-cli","comando obsidian","interfaz de línea de comandos","parámetros","banderas","herramientas de desarrollo","CLI","Obsidian","documentación de obsidian-cli"],"fr":["obsidian-cli","commande obsidian","interface de ligne de commande","paramètres","indicateurs","outils de développement","CLI","Obsidian","documentation de obsidian-cli"],"de":["obsidian-cli","Obsidian-Befehl","Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle","Parameter","Flags","Entwicklungstools","CLI","Obsidian","Dokumentation von obsidian-cli"],"pt":["obsidian cli","linha de comando obsidian","guias de configuração obsidian","ferramentas de desenvolvimento obsidian","comandos obsidian","parâmetros obsidian","flags obsidian"],"ru":["obsidian cli","командная строка obsidian","руководства по настройке obsidian","инструменты разработки obsidian","команды obsidian","параметры obsidian","флаги obsidian"],"ar":["obsidian cli","سطر أوامر obsidian","دلائل إعداد obsidian","أدوات تطوير obsidian","أوامر obsidian","معلمات obsidian","أعلام obsidian"]}},"owner":"edrickleong","repo":"obsidian-beautiful-mermaid","repoPath":"edrickleong/obsidian-beautiful-mermaid","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-05T14:48:08Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"obsidian-cli","description":"Interact with Obsidian vaults using the Obsidian CLI to read, create, search, and manage notes, tasks, properties, and more. Also supports plugin and theme development with commands to reload plugins, run JavaScript, capture errors, take screenshots, and inspect the DOM. Use when the user asks to interact with their Obsidian vault, manage notes, search vault content, perform vault operations from the command line, or develop and debug Obsidian plugins and themes.","bodyPreview":"# Obsidian CLI\n\nUse the `obsidian` CLI to interact with a running Obsidian instance. Requires Obsidian to be open.\n\n## Command reference\n\nRun `obsidian help` to see all available commands. This is always up to date. Full docs: https://help.obsidian.md/cli\n\n## Syntax\n\n**Parameters** take a value with `=`. Quote values with spaces:\n\n```bash\nobsidian create name=\"My Note\" content=\"Hello world\"\n```\n\n**Flags** are boolean switches with no value:\n\n```bash\nobsidian create name=\"My Note\" silent overwrit","body":"# Obsidian CLI\n\nUse the `obsidian` CLI to interact with a running Obsidian instance. Requires Obsidian to be open.\n\n## Command reference\n\nRun `obsidian help` to see all available commands. This is always up to date. Full docs: https://help.obsidian.md/cli\n\n## Syntax\n\n**Parameters** take a value with `=`. Quote values with spaces:\n\n```bash\nobsidian create name=\"My Note\" content=\"Hello world\"\n```\n\n**Flags** are boolean switches with no value:\n\n```bash\nobsidian create name=\"My Note\" silent overwrite\n```\n\nFor multiline content use `\\n` for newline and `\\t` for tab.\n\n## File targeting\n\nMany commands accept `file` or `path` to target a file. Without either, the active file is used.\n\n- `file=<name>` — resolves like a wikilink (name only, no path or extension needed)\n- `path=<path>` — exact path from vault root, e.g. `folder/note.md`\n\n## Vault targeting\n\nCommands target the most recently focused vault by default. Use `vault=<name>` as the first parameter to target a specific vault:\n\n```bash\nobsidian vault=\"My Vault\" search query=\"test\"\n```\n\n## Common patterns\n\n```bash\nobsidian read file=\"My Note\"\nobsidian create name=\"New Note\" content=\"# Hello\" template=\"Template\" silent\nobsidian append file=\"My Note\" content=\"New line\"\nobsidian search query=\"search term\" limit=10\nobsidian daily:read\nobsidian daily:append content=\"- [ ] New task\"\nobsidian property:set name=\"status\" value=\"done\" file=\"My Note\"\nobsidian tasks daily todo\nobsidian tags sort=count counts\nobsidian backlinks file=\"My Note\"\n```\n\nUse `--copy` on any command to copy output to clipboard. Use `silent` to prevent files from opening. Use `total` on list commands to get a count.\n\n## Plugin development\n\n### Develop/test cycle\n\nAfter making code changes to a plugin or theme, follow this workflow:\n\n1. **Reload** the plugin to pick up changes:\n   ```bash\n   obsidian plugin:reload id=my-plugin\n   ```\n2. **Check for errors** — if errors appear, fix and repeat from step 1:\n   ```bash\n   obsidian dev:errors\n   ```\n3. **Verify visually** with a screenshot or DOM inspection:\n   ```bash\n   obsidian dev:screenshot path=screenshot.png\n   obsidian dev:dom selector=\".workspace-leaf\" text\n   ```\n4. **Check console output** for warnings or unexpected logs:\n   ```bash\n   obsidian dev:console level=error\n   ```\n\n### Additional developer commands\n\nRun JavaScript in the app context:\n\n```bash\nobsidian eval code=\"app.vault.getFiles().length\"\n```\n\nInspect CSS values:\n\n```bash\nobsidian dev:css selector=\".workspace-leaf\" prop=background-color\n```\n\nToggle mobile emulation:\n\n```bash\nobsidian dev:mobile on\n```\n\nRun `obsidian help` to see additional developer commands including CDP and debugger controls.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:15:56.472Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Note-Taking Agents needing advanced Obsidian instance interaction capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Obsidian实例交互能力的笔记记录代理。","ja":"Obsidianインスタンスの高度な相互作用機能を必要とするノートテイクエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Obsidian 인스턴스 상호 작용 기능이 필요한 노트 작성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Notas que necesitan capacidades de interacción avanzadas con instancias de Obsidian.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de prise de notes nécessitant des capacités d''interaction avancées avec des instances Obsidian.","de":"Perfekt für Notiz-Agents, die erweiterte Interaktionsfunktionen für Obsidian-Instanzen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Notas que precisam de capacidades avançadas de interação com instâncias do Obsidian.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов заметок, которым необходимы расширенные возможности взаимодействия с экземплярами Obsidian.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة للتفاعل مع مثيلات Obsidian."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage notes using the `obsidian` command-line interface, providing features like note creation with custom content and silent overwrite flags, all accessible through a comprehensive command reference.","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理笔记的能力，使用`obsidian`命令行接口，提供创建笔记自定义内容和静默覆盖标志等功能，所有功能都可以通过综合命令参考访问。","ja":"エージェントが`obsidian`コマンドラインインターフェイスを使用してノートを作成および管理できるようにし、ノートを作成してカスタムコンテンツとサイレントオーバーライドフラグなどの機能を提供し、包括的なコマンドリファレンスを介してすべての機能にアクセスできるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 `obsidian` 명령줄 인터페이스를 사용하여 노트를 생성하고 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 노트 생성시 사용자 지정 내용 및 무음 덮어쓰기 플래그 등의 기능을 제공하여, 포괄적인 명령 참조를 통해 모든 기능에 액세스 할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y gestionar notas utilizando la interfaz de línea de comandos `obsidian`, proporcionando características como la creación de notas con contenido personalizado y banderas de sobrescritura silenciosa, todo accesible a través de una referencia de comandos integral.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des notes en utilisant l''interface de ligne de commande `obsidian`, offrant des fonctionnalités telles que la création de notes avec un contenu personnalisé et des drapeaux de réécriture silencieux, le tout accessible via une référence de commande complète.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Notizen zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem sie die Befehlszeilen-Schnittstelle `obsidian` verwenden, mit Funktionen wie Notizen mit benutzerdefiniertem Inhalt und stummer Überschreibung, alles über eine umfassende Befehlsreferenz zugänglich.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e gerenciar notas usando a interface de linha de comando `obsidian`, fornecendo recursos como criação de notas com conteúdo personalizado e flags de sobrescrita silenciosa, todos acessíveis por meio de uma referência de comando abrangente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и управлять заметками с помощью командной строки `obsidian`, обеспечивая функции, такие как создание заметок с пользовательским содержимым и флагами бесшумной перезаписи, все доступные через всестороннюю справку по командам.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء من إنشاء وإدارة الملاحظات باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر `obsidian` ، وتوفر ميزات مثل إنشاء ملاحظات بمحتوى مخصص وأعلام الكتابة فوق بصمت ، جميعها يمكن الوصول إليها من خلال مرجع أوامر شامل."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating notes with custom names and content","Managing existing notes using the `obsidian` CLI","Automating note creation workflows with silent and overwrite flags"],"zh":["使用自定义名称和内容创建笔记","使用`obsidian` CLI管理现有笔记","使用静默和覆盖标志自动创建笔记工作流"],"ja":["カスタム名とコンテンツでノートを作成する","`obsidian` CLIを使用して既存のノートを管理する","サイレントおよびオーバーライドフラグを使用してノート作成のワークフローを自動化する"],"ko":["사용자 지정 이름 및 내용으로 노트 생성","`obsidian` CLI를 사용하여 기존 노트 관리","무음 및 덮어쓰기 플래그를 사용하여 노트 생성 워크플로 자동화"],"es":["Crear notas con nombres y contenido personalizados","Gestionar notas existentes utilizando la interfaz de línea de comandos `obsidian`","Automatizar flujos de trabajo de creación de notas con banderas silenciosas y de sobrescritura"],"fr":["Créer des notes avec des noms et un contenu personnalisés","Gérer des notes existantes en utilisant l''interface de ligne de commande `obsidian`","Automatiser les flux de travail de création de notes avec des drapeaux silencieux et de réécriture"],"de":["Notizen mit benutzerdefinierten Namen und Inhalt erstellen","Vorhandene Notizen mit der Befehlszeilen-Schnittstelle `obsidian` verwalten","Notiz-Erstellungs-Workflows mit stummer und Überschreibung-Flags automatisieren"],"pt":["Criar notas com nomes e conteúdo personalizados","Gerenciar notas existentes usando a interface de linha de comando `obsidian`","Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de criação de notas com flags silenciosos e de sobrescrita"],"ru":["Создание заметок с пользовательскими именами и содержимым","Управление существующими заметками с помощью командной строки `obsidian`","Автоматизация рабочих процессов создания заметок с бесшумными и флагами перезаписи"],"ar":["إنشاء ملاحظات بأسماء ومحتوى مخصص","إدارة الملاحظات الحالية باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر `obsidian`","توفير سير عمل إنشاء الملاحظات تلقائيًا مع أعلام الكتابة فوق وأعلام الصمت"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Obsidian to be open","Command-line interface only","No graphical user interface support"],"zh":["需要Obsidian打开","仅命令行接口","不支持图形用户界面"],"ja":["Obsidianが開いている必要がある","コマンドラインインターフェイスのみ","グラフィカルユーザーインターフェイスはサポートされていない"],"ko":["Obsidian이 열려 있어야 함","명령줄 인터페이스만","그래픽 사용자 인터페이스 지원 안됨"],"es":["Requiere que Obsidian esté abierto","Solo interfaz de línea de comandos","No hay soporte para interfaz gráfica de usuario"],"fr":["Exige que Obsidian soit ouvert","Interface de ligne de commande uniquement","Aucun support pour l''interface graphique utilisateur"],"de":["Obsidian muss geöffnet sein","Nur Befehlszeilen-Schnittstelle","Keine Unterstützung für grafische Benutzeroberfläche"],"pt":["Requer que o Obsidian esteja aberto","Apenas interface de linha de comando","Sem suporte para interface gráfica de usuário"],"ru":["Требует открытого Obsidian","Только командная строка","Нет поддержки графического интерфейса пользователя"],"ar":["يتطلب أن يكون Obsidian مفتوحًا","واجهة سطر الأوامر فقط","لا يدعم واجهة المستخدم الرسومية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"b54257cdc0e5d04488b35b0c797bfe427b24359f0848d3c73924dcacf8da6358","qualityScore":36}');
