berprüfung","Anwendung von Entwicklungs-Konventionen","Verbesserung der Code-Qualität","Integration mit Entwicklungs-Tools","Unterstützung für mehrere Programmiersprachen"],"pt":["Teste de integração de front-end e agentes de IA","Utilização de convenções para validar resultados","Integração com Lab 04 para testes avançados","Suporte a múltiplas linguagens de programação","Interface de usuário intuitiva para configuração"],"ru":["Тестирование интеграции фронтенда и ИИ Агентов","Использование конвенций для проверки результатов","Интеграция с Lab 04 для продвинутых тестов","Поддержка нескольких языков программирования","Интуитивно понятный интерфейс пользователя для конфигурации"],"ar":["اختبار دمج الواجهة الأمامية وأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","استخدام الاتفاقيات لتحقق من النتائج","دمج مع Lab 04 للاختبارات المتقدمة","دعم لعدة لغات برمجة","واجهة مستخدم متوافقة لتهيئة الإعدادات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用review-via-conventions","什么是AI工具","review-via-conventions替代品","review-via-conventions vs 其他工具","review-via-conventions安装","review-via-conventions设置指南","AI工具开发","Lab 04开发"],"ja":["review-via-conventionsの使い方","AIエージェントとは","review-via-conventionsの代替品","review-via-conventions vs その他のツール","review-via-conventionsのインストール","review-via-conventionsの設定ガイド","AIエージェント開発","Lab 04開発"],"ko":["review-via-conventions 사용법","AI 에이전트란","review-via-conventions 대체품","review-via-conventions vs 다른 툴","review-via-conventions 설치","review-via-conventions 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 개발","Lab 04 개발"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de AI","qué es la revisión de código","herramientas de AI para desarrollo","revisión de código automática","mejora de la calidad del código","alternativas a las herramientas de AI","instalación de herramientas de AI","guía de configuración de herramientas de AI"],"fr":["comment utiliser les outils d''IA","quoi est-ce que la revue de code","outils d''IA pour le développement","révision de code automatique","amélioration de la qualité du code","alternatives aux outils d''IA","installation des outils d''IA","guide de configuration des outils d''IA"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist die Code-Überprüfung","KI-Tools für die Entwicklung","automatische Code-Überprüfung","Verbesserung der Code-Qualität","Alternativen zu KI-Tools","Installation von KI-Tools","Konfigurations-Anleitung für KI-Tools"],"pt":["como usar ferramentas de IA","o que são agentes de IA","ferramentas de IA alternativas","configurar agentes de IA","guia de instalação de ferramentas de IA","ferramentas de IA vs concorrentes","desenvolvimento de aplicativos com IA","integração de IA com front-end"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое ИИ Агенты","ИИ Агенты альтернативы","настройка ИИ Агентов","руководство по установке ИИ Агентов","ИИ Агенты vs конкуренты","разработка приложений с ИИ","интеграция ИИ с фронтендом"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هي أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي بديلة","تهيئة أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل تثبيت أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي مقابل المنافسين","تطوير التطبيقات مع الذكاء الاصطناعي","دمج الذكاء الاصطناعي مع الواجهة الأمامية"]}},"owner":"inno-se-toolkit","repo":"se-toolkit-lab-4","repoPath":"inno-se-toolkit/se-toolkit-lab-4","stars":0,"forks":242,"updatedAt":"2026-03-03T09:39:19Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"review-via-conventions","description":"Review a task file for convention violations","bodyPreview":"Review a single file for violations of the lab authoring conventions. The file must be under `lab/tasks/` or `wiki/`.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Parse `$ARGUMENTS` to get the file path. Accept paths under `lab/tasks/` (e.g., `lab/tasks/setup.md`, `lab/tasks/required/task-2.md`) or `wiki/` (e.g., `wiki/web-development.md`). If the path is missing or does not point to a file under one of these directories, ask the user.\n2. Read the target file.\n3. Read the convention files that apply to the target file:\n   - *","body":"Review a single file for violations of the lab authoring conventions. The file must be under `lab/tasks/` or `wiki/`.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Parse `$ARGUMENTS` to get the file path. Accept paths under `lab/tasks/` (e.g., `lab/tasks/setup.md`, `lab/tasks/required/task-2.md`) or `wiki/` (e.g., `wiki/web-development.md`). If the path is missing or does not point to a file under one of these directories, ask the user.\n2. Read the target file.\n3. Read the convention files that apply to the target file:\n   - **For `lab/tasks/` files:**\n     - `instructors/context/conventions/common.md` — writing conventions (4.1–4.23)\n     - `instructors/context/conventions/tasks.md` — task structure (Section 3) and design principles (Section 12)\n   - **For `wiki/` files:**\n     - `instructors/context/conventions/common.md` — writing conventions (4.1–4.23)\n     - `instructors/context/conventions/wiki.md` — wiki file structure and section patterns\n4. Go through the target file **line by line**. Check it against **every** convention in both files. Flag each violation with its line number.\n5. Scan for `<!-- TODO ... -->` comments. Report each one with its line number and the comment text.\n6. Scan for empty sections: a heading immediately followed by another heading, a `<!-- TODO ... -->` comment, or end of file, with no real content lines in between. Report each empty section with its line number and heading text.\n\n## Rules\n\n- The convention files are the single source of truth. Check every rule they contain — do not skip any.\n- Do not invent rules beyond what the convention files state.\n- Be strict: flag every violation, no matter how small.\n- Do not fix anything — only report.\n- If a convention does not apply to the file (e.g., the file has no Docker commands), skip that category and note \"Not applicable.\"\n- For `lab/tasks/setup.md`: skip task-only conventions (Section 3 template, acceptance criteria format). Apply all `common.md` conventions.\n\n## Output format\n\nWrite the report to `tmp/review-via-conventions/<repo-root-path>`, where `<repo-root-path>` is the file''s path from the repository root (e.g., `tmp/review-via-conventions/lab/tasks/setup.md` for `lab/tasks/setup.md`, `tmp/review-via-conventions/wiki/web-development.md` for `wiki/web-development.md`). Create intermediate directories if they do not exist.\n\nThe report must be self-contained so another session or agent can act on it without extra context. Structure:\n\n1. **Header** — file path reviewed, date, convention files used.\n2. **Findings** — grouped by convention number (e.g., \"4.2. Terminal commands\", \"Section 3. Task document structure\"). Under each group, list findings as numbered items with line numbers. If a group has no findings, write \"No issues found.\"\n3. **TODOs** — list every `<!-- TODO ... -->` comment with its line number and text. If none, write \"No TODOs found.\"\n4. **Empty sections** — list every heading that has no content (only a TODO comment, another heading, or EOF follows). Include line number and heading text. If none, write \"No empty sections found.\"\n5. **Summary** — total violation count (conventions + TODOs + empty sections) and a short overall assessment.\n\nAfter writing the file, print its path in the conversation so the user can find it.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:37:58.451Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring adherence to lab authoring conventions in Markdown files.","zh":"适用于需要遵守实验室作者约定在 Markdown 文件中的代码审查代理。","ja":"Markdown ファイルでラボ著者規約に従う必要があるコードレビュー代理に最適です。","ko":"Markdown 파일에서 실험실 저자 규칙을 준수해야 하는 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisión de Código que requieren adherirse a las convenciones de autoría de laboratorio en archivos Markdown.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Révision de Code nécessitant l''adhésion aux conventions d''écriture de laboratoire dans les fichiers Markdown.","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agents, die die Einhaltung der Laborveröffentlichungskonventionen in Markdown-Dateien erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que exigem adesão às convenções de autoria do lab em arquivos Markdown.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов проверки кода, требующих соблюдения соглашений лаборатории по написанию в файлах Markdown.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء مراجعة التعليمات البرمجية التي تتطلب الالتزام باتفاقيات كتابة المختبر في ملفات Markdown."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce consistency by parsing Markdown files under `lab/tasks/` or `wiki/` directories, verifying compliance with predefined conventions, and reporting violations using file paths and directory structures.","zh":"赋予代理人通过解析 `lab/tasks/` 或 `wiki/` 目录下的 Markdown 文件、验证其是否符合预定义的约定并使用文件路径和目录结构报告违规行为来强制执行一致性的能力。","ja":"`lab/tasks/` または `wiki/` ディレクトリ内の Markdown ファイルを解析し、事前に定義された規約への準拠を確認し、ファイルパスとディレクトリ構造を使用して違反を報告することで、エージェントが一貫性を強制することを可能にします。","ko":"`lab/tasks/` 또는 `wiki/` 디렉토리 내의 Markdown 파일을 파싱하여 미리 정의된 규칙을 준수하는지 확인하고 파일 경로 및 디렉토리 구조를 사용하여 위반을 보고하여 에이전트가 일관성을 강제할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes hacer cumplir la coherencia analizando archivos Markdown bajo los directorios `lab/tasks/` o `wiki/`, verificando el cumplimiento de las convenciones preestablecidas y notificando las violaciones utilizando rutas de archivo y estructuras de directorio.","fr":"Permet aux agents de faire respecter la cohérence en analysant les fichiers Markdown sous les répertoires `lab/tasks/` ou `wiki/`, en vérifiant la conformité aux conventions prédéfinies et en signalant les violations en utilisant les chemins de fichier et les structures de répertoire.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Konsistenz durchzusetzen, indem sie Markdown-Dateien unter den Verzeichnissen `lab/tasks/` oder `wiki/` parsen, die Einhaltung vordefinierter Konventionen überprüfen und Verstöße mithilfe von Dateipfaden und Verzeichnisstrukturen melden.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a impor a consistência através da análise de arquivos Markdown nos diretórios `lab/tasks/` ou `wiki/`, verificando a conformidade com convenções predefinidas e relatando violações usando caminhos de arquivo e estruturas de diretórios.","ru":"Позволяет агентам обеспечивать единообразие путем анализа файлов Markdown в каталогах `lab/tasks/` или `wiki/`, проверки соответствия предопределенным соглашениям и сообщения о нарушениях с использованием путей к файлам и структур каталогов.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من فرض الاتساق من خلال تحليل ملفات Markdown في مجلدات `lab/tasks/` أو `wiki/`، والتحقق من الامتثال للاتفاقيات المحددة مسبقًا، والإبلاغ عن المخالفات باستخدام مسارات الملفات وهياكل الدلائل."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating Markdown files against lab conventions","Automating content analysis for consistency","Debugging non-compliant files in `lab/tasks/` or `wiki/` directories"],"zh":["验证 Markdown 文件是否符合实验室约定","自动化内容分析以确保一致性","调试 `lab/tasks/` 或 `wiki/` 目录内不符合约定的文件"],"ja":["Markdown ファイルがラボ規約に準拠していることを検証する","一貫性を確保するためのコンテンツ分析の自動化","`lab/tasks/` または `wiki/` ディレクトリ内の規約に準拠していないファイルのデバッグ"],"ko":["Markdown 파일이 실험실 규칙을 준수하는지 확인","일관성을 보장하기 위한 콘텐츠 분석 자동화","`lab/tasks/` 또는 `wiki/` 디렉토리 내의 규칙을 준수하지 않는 파일의 디버깅"],"es":["Validar archivos Markdown frente a las convenciones de laboratorio","Automatizar el análisis de contenido para la coherencia","Depurar archivos no conformes en los directorios `lab/tasks/` o `wiki/`"],"fr":["Valider les fichiers Markdown par rapport aux conventions de laboratoire","Automatiser l''analyse de contenu pour la cohérence","Déboguer les fichiers non conformes dans les répertoires `lab/tasks/` ou `wiki/`"],"de":["Überprüfen von Markdown-Dateien gegen Laborübereinkünfte","Automatisieren der Inhaltsanalyse für Konsistenz","Fehlerbehebung nicht konformer Dateien in den Verzeichnissen `lab/tasks/` oder `wiki/`"],"pt":["Validação de arquivos Markdown em relação às convenções do lab","Automatização da análise de conteúdo para consistência","Depuração de arquivos não conformes nos diretórios `lab/tasks/` ou `wiki/`"],"ru":["Проверка файлов Markdown на соответствие соглашениям лаборатории","Автоматизация анализа содержания для обеспечения единообразия","Отладка несоответствующих файлов в каталогах `lab/tasks/` или `wiki/`"],"ar":["التحقق من صحة ملفات Markdown مقابل اتفاقيات المختبر","أتمتة تحليل المحتوى لضمان الاتساق","تصحيح أخطاء الملفات غير الممتثلة في مجلدات `lab/tasks/` أو `wiki/`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires file system access to read Markdown files","Limited to files under `lab/tasks/` or `wiki/` directories"],"zh":["需要文件系统访问权限来读取 Markdown 文件","仅限于 `lab/tasks/` 或 `wiki/` 目录下的文件"],"ja":["Markdown ファイルを読み取るためにファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","`lab/tasks/` または `wiki/` ディレクトリ内のファイルのみに限定される"],"ko":["Markdown 파일을 읽어들이기 위해 파일 시스템 액세스가 필요","`lab/tasks/` 또는 `wiki/` 디렉토리 내의 파일만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos para leer archivos Markdown","Limitado a archivos bajo los directorios `lab/tasks/` o `wiki/`"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers pour lire les fichiers Markdown","Limité aux fichiers sous les répertoires `lab/tasks/` ou `wiki/`"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Dateisystem, um Markdown-Dateien zu lesen","Begrenzt auf Dateien unter den Verzeichnissen `lab/tasks/` oder `wiki/`"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema de arquivos para ler arquivos Markdown","Limitado a arquivos nos diretórios `lab/tasks/` ou `wiki/`"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к файловой системе для чтения файлов Markdown","Ограничено файлами в каталогах `lab/tasks/` или `wiki/`"],"ar":["يتطلب وصولاً إلى نظام الملفات لقراءة ملفات Markdown","يقتصر على الملفات الموجودة في مجلدات `lab/tasks/` أو `wiki/`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"640b9f10506223976f97967a4e5b494ea882580c18ee5c9e38ff84df61112cb9","qualityScore":36}');
