INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('moorestech/moorestech/creating-server-protocol', 'creating-server-protocol', 'moorestech', 'moorestech', 'community', 'creating-server-protocol moorestech moorestech community csharp dotnet dotnet-core dotnetcore game game-development game-server realtime-server unity unity3d unity3d-game The creating-server-protocol skill helps game developers create automated factory game servers using C#, .NET Core, and Unity. It supports Request-Response and Event-type protocols. 创建服务器协议是游戏开发中的关键步骤，本指南介绍了Request-Response型和Event型协议的选择和实现，使用C#和Unity3D。 サーバープロトコル作成はゲーム開発における重要なステップです。本ガイドでは、Request-Response型とEvent型のプロトコルの選択と実装方法を紹介します。C#とUnity3Dを使用。 서버 프로토콜 생성은 게임 개발의 중요한 단계입니다. 이 가이드에서는 Request-Response 및 Event 유형의 프로토콜 선택 및 구현 방법을介绍합니다. C# 및 Unity3D 사용 El protocolo de servidor es fundamental para los juegos de mundo abierto automatizados. Aprende a crear uno con C# y Unity. Le protocole de serveur est essentiel pour les jeux de monde ouvert automatisés. Découvrez comment en créer un avec C# et Unity. Das Server-Protokoll ist für automatisierte Open-World-Spiele unerlässlich. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie eines mit C# und Unity erstellen. Crie um protocolo de servidor para jogos em tempo real com C# e .NET Core, incluindo Request-Response e Eventos Создайте протокол сервера для игр в реальном времени с помощью C# и .NET Core, включая Request-Response и события انشئ بروتوكول خادم للألعاب في الوقت الفعلي باستخدام C# و .NET Core، بما في ذلك الطلب والاستجابة والأحداث how to create a server protocol for Unity creating-server-protocol setup guide Request-Response protocol example Event-type protocol tutorial Unity game server development C# and .NET Core for game development creating-server-protocol vs other game server protocols 创建服务器协议 Request-Response型协议 Event型协议 C#游戏开发 Unity3D游戏开发 实时服务器通信 MessagePack数据序列化 Generates protocol classes using C# and .NET Core Supports Request-Response and Event-type protocols for real-time communication Uses MessagePack for efficient data serialization Creates packet response files in the `moorestech_server/Assets/Scripts/Server.Protocol/PacketResponse/` directory Follows protocol patterns and code examples from `references/protocol-patterns.md` creating-server-protocol is a skill for creating server protocols for Unity game development, supporting Request-Response and Event-type protocols for real-time communication.');
