INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('opensrcdevelop/auth/git-worktree', 'git-worktree', 'opensrcdevelop', 'auth', 'community', 'git-worktree opensrcdevelop auth community The git-worktree skill enables developers to manage Git worktrees efficiently, supporting creation, listing, and deletion operations. It benefits developers working on multiple projects or branches. Git Worktree 管理命令提供创建、列表查看和删除工作树的功能，支持 iTerm2 集成 Git Worktree 管理コマンドは、作成、リスト表示、削除などのワークツリー操作をサポートし、iTerm2 との統合も可能 Git Worktree 관리 명령어는 작업 트리를 생성, 목록 보기, 삭제하는 기능을 제공하며 iTerm2와의 통합을 지원합니다 Git-worktree es una herramienta para gestionar proyectos de Git. Permite crear, listar y eliminar worktrees de manera sencilla. Git-worktree est un outil pour gérer les projets Git. Il permet de créer, de lister et de supprimer des worktrees de manière simple. Git-worktree ist ein Tool zur Verwaltung von Git-Projekten. Es ermöglicht die einfache Erstellung, Auflistung und Löschung von Worktrees. O git-worktree é uma ferramenta para gerenciar worktrees em projetos Git. Ele permite criar, listar e remover worktrees de forma eficiente. Git Worktree - это инструмент для управления worktrees в проектах Git. Он позволяет создавать, просматривать и удалять worktrees эффективно с ИИ Агентами. Git Worktree هو أداة لإدارة worktrees في مشاريع Git. يسمح بإنشاء وفرز وإزالة worktrees بفعالية مع الأدوات الذكية. how to use git-worktree git-worktree setup guide git-worktree vs git submodule git-worktree install what is git-worktree git-worktree alternative git-worktree tutorial git-worktree best practices Git Worktree AIエージェント Git 管理命令 工作树管理 iTerm2 集成 开发流程优化 Creates new worktrees using the `/git-worktree init` command Lists all existing worktrees with the `/git-worktree list` command Removes worktrees using the `/git-worktree remove` command Automatically infers branch type based on user task description Supports integration with iTerm2 for seamless workflow git-worktree is a Git management command that allows users to create, list, and remove worktrees, streamlining project development and branch management.');
